{"kind":"symbol","seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Processing","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNParser","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNFormatter"],"title":"Processing","generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GMNNormalizer"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/UsingIvorGMN"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Normalization is what makes a score fully typed","level":2,"anchor":"Normalization-is-what-makes-a-score-fully-typed"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNParser"},{"text":" promotes only the tags that bind cleanly as written. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"normalizer performs the repairs that let the rest promote, then re-runs","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"promotion on the result:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"a tag-name alias is collapsed to its canonical long form;","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"a deprecated parameter name is renamed to its current one;","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"$variable"},{"type":"text","text":" reference in tag-parameter position is substituted by its"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"declared value;"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"a parameter of the wrong type is dropped, since such a value is inert —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"\\staccato<0.5>","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" means the same as a bare ","type":"text"},{"code":"\\staccato","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":";"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"so is one written to a tag that keeps none, one written on an ","type":"text"},{"code":"…End","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tag, and a raw (unquoted) identifier, none of which anything reads;","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"a unit written on a parameter that cannot carry one is dropped, keeping"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the magnitude."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Each of those is something Guido provably never reads, which is what","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"licenses the repair: the score’s meaning is unchanged and the loss is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"announced rather than silent. The one thing no repair touches is a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"$variable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" reference no declaration answers, which has to survive to be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reported.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Each is reported as a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/Change"},{"text":". Re-running promotion is safe because","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"promotion is a total, idempotent function of a tag’s name and parameters,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with the two untyped lanes as its fallback: a tag that still does not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"bind is carried through exactly as written.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The visible consequence is that "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"a parsed score is less typed than a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"normalized one","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":". A consumer that switches over "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag"},{"text":" should read a","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"score whose "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNScore\/isNormalized"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"What it does not do","type":"heading","anchor":"What-it-does-not-do"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Normalization never fails. Three defects survive every repair above — a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"required parameter still missing, an unnamed parameter past the end of the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tag’s template, and a value the tag’s own class cannot read — and each is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"carried through to ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator","type":"reference"},{"text":", which reports it as an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator\/Issue","type":"reference"},{"text":". Judging is the validator’s job; this stage only","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"repairs, so a caller that wants a diagnosis calls","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator\/validate(_:)"},{"text":" on what it gets back.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A tag carrying one of those three stays on an untyped lane, which is what","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"gives the validator something to read. Otherwise the only untyped tags left","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"after normalization are the ones that belong there: ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/custom(_:)"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whose name GMN does not reserve at all, and ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/reserved(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which is down to the three reserved names no typed payload claims —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"\\port","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"\\DrHoos","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and ","type":"text"},{"code":"\\DrRenz","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN"]]},"sections":[],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"IvorGMN"}],"externalID":"s:7IvorGMN13GMNNormalizerV","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"GMNNormalizer","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"GMNNormalizer","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GMNNormalizer"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A type that normalizes a Guido Music Notation score to canonical form."}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/init()"],"title":"Initializers","generated":true},{"anchor":"Instance-Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/normalize(_:)"],"title":"Instance Methods","generated":true},{"anchor":"Enumerations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/G